{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sPPdLAQ4161795100471.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>競委會就恒豐酒店等合謀定價案的罰款上訴得直。</p><p></p><p>罰款提高至95萬元，較原本的10萬4千元高約8倍。上訴庭認為，原罰款未能反映違法行為的嚴重性，亦不夠阻嚇力。另外恒豐亦須支付競委會上訴及原審聆訊訟費。競委會指，判決帶出任何協助，促成反競爭行為的第三方，同樣要承擔法律後果及罰款的重要訊息，具阻嚇作用。</p><p></p><p>競委會2022年入稟審裁處，指包括恒豐酒店在內多個酒店集團，在酒店內銷售旅遊景點及車票時合謀定價，違反《競爭條例》。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:39:28.647453+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T17:14:25.116324+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T15:32:50.438905+00:00","content_hash":"c7fb00013423d44b56db5ac7be126d2a4ff3751902d491ca1c327cf5170fa080","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:39:28.647453+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}